OL,3,GNEWSALandlords warned over neglected
OL,4,Acity buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Stoke-on-Trent City
OL,7,FCouncil has issued a warning to
OL,8,Flandlords whose buildings fall into
OL,9,Fdisrepair, urging them to "take
OL,10,Faction".
OL,12,FCouncillor Jane Ashworth's plea came
OL,13,Fafter the owner of Blackburn House in
OL,14,FHanley rejected the authority's offer
OL,15,Fto buy the property.
OL,17,FThe 11-storey tower block has been
OL,18,Fvacant since HM Revenue and Customs
OL,19,Fclosed down its office there in 2019.
OL,20,FPlans to convert it into flats were
OL,21,Fapproved in 2025 but work has yet to
OL,22,Fstart.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
