OL,3,GNEWSALandlords warned over neglected
OL,4,Acity buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshworth told BBC Radio Stoke the lack
OL,7,Fof a sale had hampered efforts to
OL,8,Fredevelop Etruscan Square and the
OL,9,Fcouncil was looking at legal routes it
OL,10,Fcould take, including compulsory
OL,11,Fpurchase. The BBC has been unable to
OL,12,Fcontact the owners.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
